WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,800
Unknown species cannot be transferred casually

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:02,800
Study in isolation first

3
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:06,380
Avoid affecting the ecological benefits of the earth

4
00:00:06,380 --> 00:00:16,820
What treasure did you find again? This is

5
00:00:16,820 --> 00:00:18,660
Regularly sized green bricks

6
00:00:18,660 --> 00:00:21,620
