8
00:00:24,540 --> 00:00:26,900
But there are no architectural ruins in this wilderness.

9
00:00:26,900 --> 00:00:29,180
How could a brick be left here alone?

10
00:00:29,180 --> 00:00:35,310
It's been thousands of years and it's still as good as new

11
00:00:35,310 --> 00:00:37,450
The code above is even more complicated.

12
00:00:37,450 --> 00:00:39,130
I put this thing up for auction and no one recognized it.

13
00:00:39,130 --> 00:00:40,370
but for me

14
00:00:40,370 --> 00:00:45,720
Definitely the key clue to discovering the coming of the treasure star

15
00:00:45,720 --> 00:00:47,120
A false alarm today

16
00:00:47,120 --> 00:00:49,000
The hand-made goods are enough to add to your needs

17
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:50,160
It’s time to go back to Wucheng
